Take one element , iterate though the sorted and find the correct
position of this element

Time complexity

Best Case (O(n)):
This occurs when the array is already sorted.
Only one comparison is needed for each element
to verify it is in the correct position.

Average Case (O(n²)) and Worst Case (O(n²))

O(1): Insertion Sort is an in-place sorting algorithm

Insertion Sort is a stable sorting algorithm
